                "text": "\ud83e\uddf5\ud83d\udea8I just sat down with healthcare experts @CoveredCA and @sabanclinic. What they told me should alarm everyone.\n\u00a0\nIf Congress doesn\u2019t renew ACA tax credits, millions of Californians will face massive premium hikes \u2014 or lose coverage entirely. (1/4) https://t.co/vlJzmJFUnL",
