                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Over the next couple of weeks, Californians will continue to receive notifications that their healthcare is going to get more expensive because of the Republican\u2019s cruel budget.\n\nHouse Republicans are nowhere to be found this week (as usual), but I\u2019m in DC working to lower costs and protect your healthcare.\n\n https://t.co/boKvnnE8hu",
