                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I said it on @FoxNews today and I\u2019ll say it again: I won\u2019t rubber-stamp a Republican agenda that rips healthcare from millions of Americans. If the bill coming from the Senate takes away your ability to see a doctor and afford your medications, I\u2019m a no. https://t.co/2aEdhrhyNh",
