                "source": "Vista Social",
                "text": "Here\u2019s the bottom line: healthcare costs are going to skyrocket for hardworking Americans across the board. Many will not be able to afford it. \n\nI\u2019ll keep fighting to make sure that you won\u2019t have to pay double or even triple for basic healthcare. You deserve to see a doctor and get the medicine you need.",
