                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As a mom, I get after my daughter when she procrastinates on doing her homework. So I find it completely unacceptable that President Trump is putting off working on one of the biggest crises facing Americans: affordability.\n\nPeople need cheaper groceries, affordable healthcare, and lower rents \u2013 now - not next year.",
